# me.zippert.dialoglite.data, que sumia do commit em silêncio.
server/server.log
server/data/

# Signing material — NEVER commit a keystore to this public repo.
# CI receives it as the ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 secret; see README.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.jks.b64
keystore.properties
